  "stageId": "act15d0_05",
  "title": "危險交易",
  "storyCode": "MB-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1b4e2a986ab88787f4628350ea1be1e9255ad104029c52450ea283f624f8e5c2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默小姐你沒事了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，其實或許我要感謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那麼，我們繼續？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們剛才說到哪裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說到安東尼對羅賓拋出橄欖枝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我正在和梅爾小姐討論安東尼的手段高超呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我覺得你可能是單純的想多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許，他當時沒有想那麼多，只是單純地想要對羅賓付出善意呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我確實無法否認這種可能性啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過如果是單純善良的人，是沒有辦法在這片大地上活下去的，赫默小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算了，我不該和你討論這個，梅爾說到哪裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及卡夫卡和安東尼討論過後，安東尼終於決定越獄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說到羅賓在醫務室裡醒來，被安東尼邀請加入越獄隊伍的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得不說，赫默小姐，我確實有些好奇你究竟是從哪裡獲得安東尼這條線索的情報的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從我的老師那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？難道帕爾維斯主任也插手了這件事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，我已經很久沒有和他直接聯絡過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且他恐怕也不知道這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自從離開萊茵生命後，我把過去很多從沒在意過的情報重新梳理了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而在那之中，我抓到了西蒙家族這條尾巴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個家族覆滅的時間很短，而且一些資料偽裝得很好，所以在很多人看來，這些資料就仿佛沒有變化過一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是偽裝總是會有痕跡的。一些報表，一些統計資料，只要詳細對比一下，就能發現其中的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原本只是抱著試試的心態過了一遍那些資料，卻沒想到讓我發現了這樣的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是偶然發現......不，其實是必然嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，你為什麼會突然去梳理一遍那些資料呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我開始不信任萊茵生命，也不信任我的老師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是“炎魔”事件嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不只是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“炎魔”導致了塞雷婭的離開，在那之後發生的一些事情想必繆爾賽思主任你比我更瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，我只是隨口問問，就這麼告訴我這些事真的好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不就是你想聽到的東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不擅長掩飾什麼，繆爾賽思主任，所以我思考過後，決定對你坦誠相待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我並不喜歡我的老師，不過他有一句話我一直記得——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“對陰謀家來說，最讓他們恐懼的是坦誠。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我被當作壞人了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，在羅德島生活的時間教會了我一件事，那就是，不是所有反對你的就應該被當作壞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，你不是壞人......塞雷婭也不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能說，我和你，和塞雷婭都無法互相理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊哈，或許吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繆爾賽思主任，你還要繼續聽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，我正聽到精彩的部分呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，不過故事應該差不多到這裡就接近尾聲了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，在那時，安東尼逃獄的隊伍就已經差不多結成了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東尼本人，入殮師杜瑪，卡夫卡，臨時工米娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再加上羅賓，就可以大家一起齊心協力越獄了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒有這麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅賓並沒有加入安東尼的隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然確實在這之後，卡夫卡就開始和杜瑪還有安東尼一起摸索越獄的方法，而且羅賓也加入了其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是事情並沒有這麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "發生了什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還記得你之前提到的海德兄弟找來的幫手嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記得，他怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他找到了羅賓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
